# Launched at both ends and in the middle: four fronts, two collisions, every site fires exactly once.
# Reference: the same network integrated independently (complex arithmetic, LSODA).
title Three pulses in a chain of 21
sites 21
path 1 21 kappa=0.06
kick 1 amplitude=2
kick 11 amplitude=2
kick 21 amplitude=2
run 1200
